}\n$$\n\nConsider the equivalence above, where $A$ is an $n\\,\\times \\,n$ matrix. Which of the following should be placed into the blank space to make a true statement?" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the *invertible matrix theorem* states the following: \n\n*Let $A$ be an $n\\,\\times \\,n$ matrix. Then we have the following equivalence:*\n\n$$\nA\\text{ is invertible}\\,⇔\\,\\{\\,\\begin{aligned} & \\text{Col}(A)={R}^{n} \\\\  & \\text{dim(Col}(A))=n=\\text{rank}(A) \\\\  & \\text{Null}(A)=\\{0\\} \\\\  & \\text{dim(Null}(A))=0=\\text{nullity}(A)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing expression is $\\text{rank}(A).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-9e061b51-851a-5ec1-9247-2cb4ee8e99e6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9e061b51-851a-5ec1-9247-2cb4ee8e99e6" :answer-field/id #uuid "9e061b51-851a-5ec1-9247-2cb4ee8e99e6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-9a43c232-d1ff-5d5b-967a-f97c5c62802c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-abf5dd86-5e61-586c-8e5b-345ea680eb42" "answer-ee0fb303-98ae-5122-984e-1ef2c8e57d8f" "answer-3307d8dd-316e-59b9-a236-3cf5704a1eda" "answer-5962da19-877d-530f-b40f-aae8873a783f" "answer-9a43c232-d1ff-5d5b-967a-f97c5c62802c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-abf5dd86-5e61-586c-8e5b-345ea680eb42" :answer/id #uuid "abf5dd86-5e61-586c-8e5b-345ea680eb42" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{Col}(A)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ee0fb303-98ae-5122-984e-1ef2c8e57d8f" :answer/id #uuid "ee0fb303-98ae-5122-984e-1ef2c8e57d8f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{Null}(A)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3307d8dd-316e-59b9-a236-3cf5704a1eda" :answer/id #uuid "3307d8dd-316e-59b9-a236-3cf5704a1eda" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{dim(Null}(A))" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5962da19-877